---
// Hero.astro
---

<section class="relative pt-32 pb-24 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative background glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-500/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/4 -translate-y-1/2 w-[300px] h-[300px] bg-pink-500/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Marketing Copy -->
      <div class="text-center lg:text-left space-y-8">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-500/10 border border-brand-500/20 text-brand-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
          ✨ Experiência Premium de Beleza
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          Sua melhor versão, com hora <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-400 to-pink-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">marcada</span>
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0">
          Escolha os melhores profissionais, consulte os horários disponíveis em tempo real e agende o seu atendimento em segundos. Sem telefonemas, sem filas, apenas estilo.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4">
          <a
            href="http://localhost:3000/agendar"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-pink-600 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-xl shadow-brand-500/20 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-pink-500 transition-all hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            Agendar Agora
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#servicos"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 hover:bg-slate-900/80 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-300 transition-all"
          >
            Ver Serviços
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Mini social proof -->
        <div class="pt-4 flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-6 border-t border-slate-900">
          <div>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">4.9/5</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Avaliação Média</p>
          </div>
          <div class="h-8 w-px bg-slate-900"></div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">+5,000</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Clientes Atendidos</p>
          </div>
          <div class="h-8 w-px bg-slate-900"></div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">100%</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Pontualidade</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Interactive Look Mockup -->
      <div class="relative hidden lg:block">
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 p-8 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-2xl space-y-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            📅 Horários Recomendados para Hoje
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <!-- Mock Slot 1 -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-900 hover:border-brand-500/20 transition-all">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-lg">
                  ✂️
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Corte de Cabelo Feminino</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Com Ana Hair Stylist • 60 min</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a href="http://localhost:3000/agendar?servicoId=1" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-400 hover:bg-brand-600 hover:text-white transition-colors">
                14:00
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Mock Slot 2 -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-900 hover:border-brand-500/20 transition-all">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-lg">
                  💅
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Manicure e Pedicure</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Com Maria Unhas • 60 min</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a href="http://localhost:3000/agendar?servicoId=4" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-400 hover:bg-brand-600 hover:text-white transition-colors">
                15:30
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Mock Slot 3 -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-900 hover:border-brand-500/20 transition-all">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-pink-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-lg">
                  🎨
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Coloração Completa</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Com Carlos Colorist • 120 min</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-950 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">
                Esgotado
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Quick Stats / Status -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-500/5 border border-brand-500/10">
            <span class="flex h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500 animate-ping"></span>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-300 font-medium">
              4 profissionais disponíveis atendendo hoje até as 18:00
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
